h>, glycerol is dehydrated and acrolein is formed.</p><p><strong>Statement II :</strong> Acrolein has fruity odour and can be used to test glycerol&#39;s presence.</p><p>Choose the correct option.</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "1c763e", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are correct.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928a362"}, {"id": "df6334", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928a363"}, {"id": "66476e", "text": "Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928a364"}, {"id": "77be1b", "text": "Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928a365"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928a366", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfae9"], "topics": ["60e2fb2066f9ce3f243b4b7b"], "concepts": ["60e2fad966f9ce3f243b4737"], "question": {"text": "Given below are two statements :<br>Statement (I) : Vanillin <img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F80hLBNLXye0c_cPG3fFQD2flMs_67kKo9RhgQjJupcY.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\"/><br>will react with NaOH and also with Tollen's reagent.<br>Statement (II) : Vanillin<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2Fm7z687cce1RyAp07RzRDwyz3O_8JZafNI61PDw2lIDc.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\"/><br>will undergo self aldol condensation very easily.<br>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :"}, "options": [{"id": "34d6af", "text": "Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928a367"}, {"id": "04663d", "text": "Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f782ee0e063d928a368"}, {"